From: Octo <180629317+OctoAlgo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:05:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/39] VICTORY_NO_WATCHDOG loader hook

From the testers build (r4tedx integration/testers 94e0ea5, upstream
VIctory PR #454): with VICTORY_NO_WATCHDOG set, the loader disarms the
title's watchdog thread, which otherwise ends the process when the main
thread stalls ~30 s (slow first world frames under Proton). Checks the
build hash and the exact bytes; does nothing otherwise.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Kit-Source: Marvisak/VIctory PR #454 (via the testers integration build), ported by Octo
Kit-Licence: GPL-3.0
